Refused: a property key with a quotation mark, which a json struct tag cannot
carry, and the two JSON builds would read differently (0019-PLAN-generator-hardening.md, G9).

-- meta.json --
{"version": 1, "agentMethods": {}, "clientMethods": {}, "protocolMethods": {"cancel_request": "$/cancel_request"}}
-- schema.json --
{"$defs": {
  "Obj": {"type": "object", "properties": {"a\"b": {"type": "string"}}},
  "CancelRequestNotification": {"type": "object", "x-side": "protocol", "x-method": "$/cancel_request"}
}}
-- want.err --
Obj.properties.a"b:
a json struct tag cannot carry this key
